# GLM_4.7_Flash Report

## Overview

DeepSeek V4.1 Flash is a balanced general-purpose model from DeepSeek AI released in September 2026, ranked #25 among 214 evaluated models on the AI Intelligence Index with score 88.4. It is a text-focused model supporting text and code generation with 100K token context window, designed for high-throughput applications requiring fast inference and balanced performance across multiple tasks.

## Model Specifications

**Model Name:** DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
**Provider:** DeepSeek AI
**Release Date:** September 2026
**Status:** Active (general-purpose model)
**Cost:** $1.50/M input tokens, $7.50/M output tokens

**Core Capabilities:**
- Text input & generation
- Code generation & debugging
- Extended reasoning capabilities
- 100K token context window
- Knowledge cutoff: August 2026

**Performance Metrics:**
- Intelligence Index: 88.4/100 (top 10% of evaluated models)
- Output Speed: ~115 tokens/second
- Context Window: 100K tokens
- Reasoning Capability: Strong enterprise applications
- Knowledge Retrieval: Good domain understanding

**Provider Availability:** Available via DeepSeek API with competitive pricing for high-volume deployments.

## Research & Evaluation

### Benchmark Performance

**AI Intelligence Index (88.4)** - Top 10% of all evaluated models, representing solid general-purpose capabilities across coding, knowledge work, and reasoning tasks.

**Reasoning Performance:** Strong intelligence index score indicates good performance across complex reasoning benchmarks, including multi-step problem solving and knowledge synthesis.

**Context Window Utilization:** 100K token context enables enterprise document workloads, research synthesis, and long-form content generation with minimal loss in performance.

**Cost Efficiency:** At $1.50/M input and $7.50/M output, positioned in the cost-effective mid-tier range, offering competitive performance per dollar compared to premium models.

### Use Case Suitability

**Enterprise Knowledge Work:** Solid performance in complex reasoning tasks aligning with business analysis, document processing, and decision support workflows.

**Code Generation & Analysis:** Good coding capabilities support software engineering workflows including generation, review, and debugging with reduced latency.

**Long Context Applications:** 100K token context window supports enterprise document workloads, including legal review, financial analysis, and research synthesis.

**High-Throughput Deployment:** Flash designation indicates optimized inference pipeline for high-volume applications requiring fast response times.

### Independent Evaluation Status

**DeepSeek AI Official Testing:** Comprehensive evaluation available through DeepSeek API with detailed benchmark coverage and evaluation suites.

**Public Documentation:** Available via DeepSeek Console with comprehensive documentation for integration and deployment.

**Community Testing:** Active evaluation across developer communities with performance benchmarks and use case demonstrations.

### Comparative Positioning

**Tier Ranking:** Positioned within top 10% of general-purpose models, competitive with leading proprietary offerings and research models.

**Cost Efficiency:** Competitive pricing structure makes it accessible for enterprise deployment across multiple sectors.

**Performance vs Cost:** Solid intelligence index at mid-tier pricing reflects optimization for quality-critical and high-throughput applications.

**Innovation Edge:** Latest version of V4.1 Flash series indicates continuous improvement in reasoning capabilities and inference efficiency.

